  R_4_hydroxymandelate
    -[node7444: 5.1.2.2]- S_4_hydroxymandelate  // mandelate racemase
    -[node7451: 1.1.99.31 | oxidized_electron_acceptor>reduced_electron_acceptor ^L]- 4_hydroxyphenylglyoxylate  // (S)-mandelate dehydrogenase
